# Mobile Flutter (package-local)

When working inside `ababilx-mobile/`, also follow monorepo rules:

- `.cursor/rules/ababilx-mobile-flutter.mdc` — folders, API, Riverpod, GoRouter
- `.cursor/rules/ababilx-mobile-ui.mdc` — theme-only colors, shell bar UX
- `.cursor/rules/ababilx-mobile-crm.mdc` — CRM permissions + contacts patterns

Quick musts:

1. Modular `features/<x>/` (screens / data / providers / small UI folders).
2. No hardcoded UI colors — `Theme.of(context).colorScheme`.
3. Shell floating bar: left pill + right circle; feature modes swap buttons (contacts = My/All + add).
4. CRM: `team_is_premium && crm_access`; actions from `module_permissions.crm`.
5. Port web API shapes from `Ababil-X-frontend` / `ababilx-server` — don't invent contracts.
6. Neutral names only: no file, class, function, test title or comment uses
   the Signal name (no `signal_*.dart`, no `Signal…` symbols). Say "the
   reference app" in prose; "signal" for call signalling is fine. Bubble/menu
   metrics live in `chat-timeline/bubble_metrics.dart` (`BubbleMetrics`, `BubbleColors`,
   `bubbleRadius`) and `message_menu_*.dart` (`MessageMenuMetrics`).
7. Never paste code from `examples/` (AGPL). If a file follows one closely, log
   it in `docs/THIRD_PARTY_PROVENANCE.md` — never hide where code came from.
